---
import BaseLayout from "../../site/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import BrandMark from "../../site/components/BrandMark.astro";
import "../../site/styles/footer-study.css";
---

<BaseLayout title="Footer study — Mourne Made" description="A visual study of footer directions for Mourne Made." hideFooter>
  <main class="footer-study">
    <div class="shell footer-study-intro">
      <a class="footer-study-back" href="/prototypes/eyebrow-study/">← Section label study</a>
      <p class="home-kicker">Mourne Made · component study</p>
      <h1>How should the site sign off?</h1>
      <p class="footer-study-lede">Three footer directions for the final handoff: quiet, committed, or neatly structured.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="shell footer-study-grid">
      <article class="footer-option"><p class="footer-option-name"><span>A</span> Quiet close</p><footer class="study-footer study-footer--quiet"><BrandMark showPlace={false} /><p>Local websites — shown before they're sold.</p><div><a href="#">Transformations</a><a href="#">Why local</a><a href="#">Contact</a></div><small>Dundrum + Newcastle, County Down</small></footer><p>Current direction, with a clear rule and plenty of air.</p></article>
      <article class="footer-option"><p class="footer-option-name"><span>B</span> Blue close</p><footer class="study-footer study-footer--blue"><BrandMark showPlace={false} /><p>Local websites — shown before they're sold.</p><div><a href="#">Transformations</a><a href="#">Why local</a><a href="#">Contact</a></div><small>Dundrum + Newcastle, County Down</small></footer><p>A strong final colour block gives the brand a memorable exit.</p></article>
      <article class="footer-option"><p class="footer-option-name"><span>C</span> Split close</p><footer class="study-footer study-footer--split"><div><BrandMark showPlace={false} /><p>Local websites — shown before they're sold.</p></div><div><a href="#">Transformations</a><a href="#">Why local</a><a href="#">Contact</a></div><small>Dundrum + Newcastle, County Down</small></footer><p>Separates identity and navigation more explicitly for faster scanning.</p></article>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
